# 第二個模型的審查輸入／輸出（見 AGENTS.md），結論落在 AI_USAGE.md
# Codex transcripts. They belong outside the repository entirely -- one written
# here is picked up by Codex's own rg sweeps and feeds itself -- but the pattern
# is general so that a new name cannot arrive unignored, which is how a 400KB
# transcript came to be sitting in a public working tree.
.codex-*

